From: AX6 NSS fix chain
Subject: [PATCH] edma_v1: fix tx ring mapping expression

The modulo operands are reversed: edma_hw.txdesc_rings % skbq should be
skbq % edma_hw.txdesc_rings. Single-ring AX6 has no functional change
but the source expression is wrong and would misroute on multi-ring DTS.

--- a/hal/dp_ops/edma_dp/edma_v1/edma_data_plane.c
+++ b/hal/dp_ops/edma_dp/edma_v1/edma_data_plane.c
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 	skbq = skb_get_queue_mapping(skb);
 	tx_ring = 0;
 	if ((edma_hw.txdesc_rings > 1) && (skbq > 0))
-		tx_ring = edma_hw.txdesc_rings % skbq;
+		tx_ring = skbq % edma_hw.txdesc_rings;
